# Support Tickets Analytics Dashboard

A clean and modern front-end **support tickets analytics dashboard** that transforms a small mock dataset into a clear overview of team performance, ticket workload, and resolution speed.

---

## 🖼 Screenshots

**Main dashboard**

![Support tickets dashboard](assets/images/dashboard-full.png)

**Filtered by status = Completed**

![Tickets filtered by status](assets/images/status-completed.png)

---

## ✨ Features

- KPI overview cards (Total, Open, Closed, Avg Resolution Time)
- Interactive tickets table with colored Status & Priority badges
- Filters for Status, Priority, Department, and Location
- “Tickets by Status” bar chart powered by Chart.js
- Agent performance section with ticket count and close rate
- Fully responsive layout (desktop → mobile cards)

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```text
support-tickets-analytics-ui/
├─ index.html                 // Main dashboard layout
└─ assets/
   ├─ css/
   │  ├─ base.css             // Global styles, typography, layout
   │  ├─ header.css           // Top header & toolbar
   │  ├─ cards.css            // KPI cards & overview sections
   │  ├─ filters.css          // Filters row styling
   │  ├─ table.css            // Tickets table & responsive cards
   │  └─ agent.css            // Agent performance list
   ├─ images/
   │  ├─ dashboard-full.png   // Main dashboard screenshot
   │  └─ status-completed.png // Filtered view screenshot
   └─ js/
      └─ main.js              // Data, KPIs, filters, and chart logic
```

