## 🚀 Getting Started

1. Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Eissa2123/support-tickets-analytics-ui.git
cd support-tickets-analytics-ui
```

2. Open the dashboard:

- Option A: open `index.html` directly in your browser  
- Option B: use a local server (e.g. VS Code Live Server)

All data is mocked inside `assets/js/main.js` to focus on UI, KPI calculations, and front-end filtering logic.

